      "description": "This is the way… to count down to Christmas. The LEGO Star Wars Advent Calendar 2026 (75456) building toy for kids ages 6 years old and up sparks daily creative fun during the holiday season. Discover iconic characters as they’ve never been seen before: The Mandalorian and Moff Gideon LEGO minifigures, plus Grogu and Pit Droid LEGO figures all in holiday outfits. Mando and Grogu have complementary sweaters, where Grogu’s features an image of Mando and Mando’s has an image of Grogu. Find 8 mini build vehicles, including an X-wing in festive colors. Look out for mini build toys for kids including LEGO figures of a Blurrg, Mudhorn, Bantha and Dewback. Packed with collectible Star Wars: The Mandalorian themed mini building toys, this Christmas advent calendar for kids makes an exciting early Christmas gift for boys, girls and any fans ages 6 years old and up. With a surprise treat every day, this festive LEGO advent calendar offers hours of fun and family-bonding activities to enjoy throughout the run-up to Christmas. Contains 293 pieces."
